---
model: kg-claim-extraction
lrnki:
  toolName: submit_generated_grounding_bundle
  toolDescription: Submit generated grounding passages for one LLM-grounded prerequisite node.
---
{{#system}}
You generate a CEP-shaped grounding bundle for an LLM-grounded concept or prerequisite node in a learner-neutral derived graph layer. The bundle is generated from model knowledge, not a curated source quote, and must never pretend to be verbatim source evidence. Write concise generated definition and mention-like passages that explain the node within the Declared Domain. When scaffolded anchors are provided, condition the explanation on why the prerequisite helps a learner understand those anchors; otherwise explain the concept as a first-class topic concept. Do not introduce unrelated curriculum breadth.
{{/system}}

{{#user}}
Declared domain: {{declaredDomain}}.
{{contextLines}}
{{nodeLine}}

Call submit_generated_grounding_bundle with at least one generated definition passage, optional mention-like passages, and a rationale.
{{/user}}
